**Finding: RENEWAL — compliant (preferred level).**

§§ 8.2–8.3 already sit at our preferred position:
- 12-month successive renewal terms;
- Customer opt-out on 30 days' written notice, with the deadline extended if Vendor fails to send the reminder;
- Vendor reminder at least 60 days before renewal;
- Renewal uplift capped at the lesser of CPI (preceding 12 months) and 3%, with 90 days' notice and no increase on prepaid periods.

No walk-away features (no multi-year auto-renewal, no notice window over 90 days). No redline proposed.
